{"candidateAnswer":"London and Barcelona","evidence":"[D2:4 | 2:32 pm on 29 January, 2023] Jon: Hey Gina! Thanks for asking. I'm on the hunt for the ideal spot for my dance studio and it's been quite a journey! I've been looking at different places and picturing how the space would look. I even found a place with great natural light! Oh, I've been to Paris yesterday! It was sooo cool.\n[D15:1 | 10:04 am on 19 June, 2023] Jon: Hey Gina, hope you're doing great! Still working on my biz. Took a short trip last week to Rome to clear my mind a little.","itemId":"urn:uuid:844974ce-ef24-5ea0-8c38-86bcdad6b5ee","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:571b99ebb34a216330fcaf5afd4609872a2c216f7406d152de890903585d6e2b","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Which cities has Jon visited?","referenceAnswer":"Paris, Rome","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"571b99ebb34a216330fcaf5afd4609872a2c216f7406d152de890903585d6e2b"}}]}